## 3. Zero Proprietary Material, Trademarks & User Compliance Notice

1. **Zero Proprietary Binaries or Keys:** Public snapshots of this repository
   contain **zero** Apple firmware, ROMs, OS images, cryptographic keys, signing
   tickets, SDK headers, or virtual disk images. No prebuilt VM bundles or
   extracted Apple components are distributed.
2. **User License Responsibility (BYOF):** Users who choose to test with
   third-party operating systems or firmware must obtain those materials
   lawfully on their own and are solely responsible for complying with all
   applicable end-user software license agreements (SLAs/EULAs) and local laws.
3. **Trademarks & Non-Affiliation:** Apple, macOS, Mac, Metal, Safari, WebKit,
   CoreAudio, and Virtualization are trademarks of Apple Inc., registered in
   the U.S. and other countries. Linux is the registered trademark of Linus
   Torvalds. Vulkan is a registered trademark of the Khronos Group Inc. All
   product and company names are mentioned strictly for nominative,
   interoperability, and identification purposes. This research project is
   **not** affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Apple Inc. or any
   other trademark holder.
